 case, would you like to have a look at our menu? We have a wide assortment of a la carte items for our vegetarian guests.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>:\tCan't I change my main for something else? I'd rather still pay the set price!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: I'm awfully sorry, sir. We do not offer substitutions for lunch."}, {"time": "43300", "image": "engenn6le05ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: That's not what I wanted to hear! Is there any way that you could check with the chef?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: I'm afraid the chef is very particular about his creations. He's very proud of his work, and a little susceptible to bad moods, if you see what I mean.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: I see ... I wouldn't want to make him angry! He's the one wielding the knife after all."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}